  "description": {
    "en": "Kirschbaum Touch Multifibre is a premium polyamide multifilament string built from approximately 1500 to 2400 high-grade microfilaments depending on gauge. The fibers are pre-stretched and twisted to create a responsive multifilament core, then protected by a ball-biting PV coating for improved durability. It delivers exceptional comfort, reduced arm strain and natural gut-like feel, power and playability. The 1.25 mm version emphasizes touch, power and ball pocketing, while the 1.30 mm version offers greater durability and stability.",

    "zh": "Kirschbaum Touch Multifibre 是一款高端聚酰胺多芯球线，根据线径不同由约 1500 至 2400 根高等级微纤维组成。球线经过预拉伸并扭合形成高响应多芯核心，外层再加入具有咬球能力的 PV 涂层，以提升耐久性。它拥有极高的舒适性、优秀避震能力以及接近天然肠线的手感、力量和可打性。1.25毫米版本更强调手感、力量和持球感；1.30毫米版本则更偏向耐久与稳定。"
  },

